<title>HUNGARY: Hungary c. bank revises 96 Y/Y inflation to 20 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary c. bank revises 96 Y/Y inflation to 20 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary Central Bank Governor Gyorgy Suranyi said on Wednesday the bank had revised its year-on-year inflation forecast for 1996 down to 20 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;Inflation has peaked and is falling steadily,&quot; Suranyi said at a news conference.</p>
</text>
